<title>UK: Merrill Lynch says sets 400 mln mark 12-yr bond. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch says sets 400 mln mark 12-yr bond. [CORRECTED 07:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO INC</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    17.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+56 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price to 102.0 from 102.5 and full fees total to 2.5 from 3.0.)</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  2.1	 LIST FEE    -</p>
<p>(Corrects to show there is no listing fee.)</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JULY 2007 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
